Description: Orbit's defaults: its applications for each file type, its look
 Opens files with the Orbit applications in an Orbit session
 (orbit-mimeapps.list), picks the portals for it (screencasts by the wlr
 one), sets the dark look (a GSettings override), and keeps example
 configurations in /usr/share/doc/orbit/examples.
Section: x11
Depends: libglib2.0-bin
